<title>USA: Halifax Corp awarded $29.5 million contract.</title>
<headline>Halifax Corp awarded $29.5 million contract.</headline>
<dateline>ALEXANDRIA, Va. 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halifax Corp said Friday that it has been awarded a contract with the U.S. Army Communications-Electronics Command for engineering, furnishing and installing communications systems and equipment in support of the Technology Applications Office, Ft. Ritchie, Maryland. The contract is for five years and has an estimated potential value of $29.5 million.</p>
